  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.<br>• Cut sweet potato and zucchini into  <br>bite-sized chunks.<br>• Place veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive <br>oil and season with a pinch of salt and pepper.<br>• Toss to coat, then roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.  </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a606c43db84428c316e36f7/step-f19e7100.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While the veggies are roasting, finely chop brown <br>onion. Drain and rinse chickpeas. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a606c43db84428c316e36f7/step-56402910.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• When the veggies have 10 minutes remaining, heat <br>a large frying pan over medium-high heat. Cook <br>onion, tossing, until softened, 4-5 minutes.<br>• Add chickpeas, diced tomatoes with garlic &amp; <br>onion, the brown sugar and a splash of water and <br>cook until slightly thickened, 4-5 minutes. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a606c43db84428c316e36f7/step-0895e220.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• To the chickpeas, add basil pesto, roasted veggies <br>and baby spinach leaves. Stir to combine. <br>• Season to taste with salt and pepper and cover to <br>keep warm.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a606c43db84428c316e36f7/step-8e32d330.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• In a medium saucepan, combine the water and milk <br>and bring to the boil over high heat. <br>• Reduce heat to medium and slowly whisk in instant <br>polenta, then cook, stirring, until smooth and <br>thickened, 2-3 minutes. <br>• Remove from heat, then add the butter, half the <br>Parmesan cheese and a good pinch of salt <br>and pepper. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a606c43db84428c316e36f7/step-58d87940.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Divide creamy polenta between bowls, then  <br>top with saucy pesto chickpeas.<br>• Sprinkle with pine nuts and the remaining <br>Parmesan cheese.<br>• Tear over parsley (see ingredients) to serve. Enjoy! </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6a606c43db84428c316e36f7/step-150bf650.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
